   "text": "• one head unifies two task types;\n  simple, reusable design\n\n• careful latency protocol: generative\n  baselines also reuse the video prefix\n\n• controlled comparison with\n  autoregressive SFT on the same data\n\n• models and code released",
   "fontSize": 22,
