   "seed": 186309129,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 642085297,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• closed set: someone must supply the candidates;\n  one contiguous span per query only\n\n• QA training data is internal; gains partly from data\n  (scoring adds +1.3 / +1.9 over autoregressive SFT)\n\n• latency excludes video decoding and preprocessing,\n  which also cost time in real systems\n\n• Joint inference: later questions see earlier ones;\n  order effects are not studied\n\n• overconfident probabilities (ECE ≈ 8 points)\n\n• 'System One' comes from a vendor blog",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "• closed set: someone must supply the candidates;\n  one contiguous span per query only\n\n• QA training data is internal; gains partly from data\n  (scoring adds +1.3 / +1.9 over autoregressive SFT)\n\n• latency excludes video decoding and preprocessing,\n  which also cost time in real systems\n\n• Joint inference: later questions see earlier ones;\n  order effects are not studied\n\n• overconfident probabilities (ECE ≈ 8 points)\n\n• 'System One' comes from a vendor blog",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
